:: Shopping Day 1e [unfinished] {"position":"4175,2300","size":"100,100"}

(metadata:
"currency", "rial",
"title", "The Booksellers' Floor",
"cardDesc", "Simple magical products for everyday use are often sold in alchemical shops.",
"parent", "S: Shopping Day 1",
"devNote", [Be careful: Do I want ''all'' books to be sold here? Or do I just want a selection? Also, books should not be affected by factors like the weather. I might have to re-divide the tables.],
)

<!--Market setup-->
<!--item list-->
(set: _itemList to (a:))
(for: each _itemDM, ...(passages: where its name contains "item."))[{
     (if: _itemDM's key contains "book")[{
        (set: _itemList to it + (a: (trimmed: "item.", _itemDM's name)))
     }]
}]
<!--buy factor-->
(set: _buyFactors to (passage: "table.marketPriceMod")'s universalBuy)
<!--sell factor-->
(set: _sellFactors to ($funcMarketMergeFactors: _buyFactors, (passage: "table.marketPriceMod")'s universalSell))
<!--define base mods-->
(set: _baseBuyMod to 1.5)
(set: _baseSellMod to .5)
<!--end of market setup-->


$cssColumnParent[

$cssColumnChild[

	(css: "font-size: 70%")[
        $cssColumnChild[(link: "⇦ Never mind.")[(goto: (passage:)'s parent)]]
     ]

	$cssBox[
    	($funcImage: (passage: "S: Shopping Day 1")'s img)
         $cssBoxItem[''(print: (passage:)'s title )''<br>(print: (passage:)'s cardDesc)]
    ]
]

$cssColumnChild[
This floor is overflowing - quite literally, you must have stepped on a few pages - with books, scrolls, parchments, and whatever media through which wisdom may be transposed. Perhaps the only wisdom that is lacking is a fear of fire hazard. 
<br>
Hung over each kiosk on this floor are various emblems from printers' guilds, copyist groups, and university presses. You know that these are only for show - prestige by association. These organizations do not typically operate shops this far away.
<br>
Nurandah might be the most literate society to ever exist, but the literati alone does not tie together the Seven Provinces. Rather, it is such wide-reaching network of mongers, such as these secondhand booksellers, that are the true civilizational threads. 
]<!--end child-->
]<!--end parent-->

---

$cssColumnParent[
$cssColumnChild[
<!--Readout-->
$cssDesc[($funcMarketReadoutFull: _baseBuyMod, _baseSellMod, _itemList, _buyFactors, _sellFactors)]
<!--end of readout-->
]<!--end child, begin another-->

$cssColumnChild[
<!--main buy/sell menu-->
<ol>
($funcMarketMain: _baseBuyMod, _baseSellMod, (passage:)'s currency, _itemList, _buyFactors, _sellFactors, 2)
<br>
Or...
<br>
<li>(link: "Never mind.")[(goto: (passage:)'s parent)]</li>
</ol>
<!--end of main buy/sell menu-->

]<!--end child-->
]<!--end parent 2-->